WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.335
The home bench (right) joins with its own team PIN: "Enter team PIN", then "Connect".

2
00:00:06.385 --> 00:00:13.385
The bench sees its own team first: time-outs, substitutions, the score and the set.

3
00:00:14.778 --> 00:00:21.778
A time-out for the home team: the bench counts it.

4
00:00:23.175 --> 00:00:30.175
A substitution: the substitution count goes up on the bench too.

5
00:00:31.744 --> 00:00:36.727
The bench follows every rally live. The other team's bench needs its own PIN.
